From 8490478c889d6d7de0082867d551925fed5c7d51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Marshall Lew <luqilinheu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 01:53:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): ship a Linux icon set the desktop can find

Installing the deb produced an application with no icon: the package
carried a single /usr/share/icons/hicolor/1104x1104/apps/deepseek-harness.png
and nothing else, so launchers asking for a 16/24/32/48/.../512 icon
found no match and fell back to the generic one.

electron-builder is asked for the Linux icon as a *set*, and for a .png
source it returns that file unchanged at its own size instead of
generating sizes (iconConverter.js: the source already has the target
extension). resources/icon.png is 1104x1104, an artwork edge rather than
a freedesktop size, so the whole set collapsed to that one directory.

Point linux.icon at a directory instead, which electron-builder reads as
one entry per size. Each size is rasterized from resources/icon.svg
rather than downscaled from the large bitmap, the way
scripts/render-tray-icon.ts already renders the Windows tray bitmaps.
---
 apps/desktop/resources/icons/128x128.png        | Bin 0 -> 8086 bytes
 apps/desktop/resources/icons/16x16.png          | Bin 0 -> 524 bytes
 apps/desktop/resources/icons/24x24.png          | Bin 0 -> 739 bytes
 apps/desktop/resources/icons/256x256.png        | Bin 0 -> 19599 bytes
 apps/desktop/resources/icons/32x32.png          | Bin 0 -> 1097 bytes
 apps/desktop/resources/icons/48x48.png          | Bin 0 -> 1978 bytes
 apps/desktop/resources/icons/512x512.png        | Bin 0 -> 44441 bytes
 apps/desktop/resources/icons/64x64.png          | Bin 0 -> 2957 bytes
 .../desktop/scripts/electron-builder-config.mjs |   6 +++++-
 9 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/resources/icons/128x128.png
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/resources/icons/16x16.png
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/resources/icons/24x24.png
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/resources/icons/256x256.png
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/resources/icons/32x32.png
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/resources/icons/48x48.png
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/resources/icons/512x512.png
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/resources/icons/64x64.png

diff --git a/apps/desktop/resources/icons/128x128.png b/apps/desktop/resources/icons/128x128.png
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..8bcf7b0206dd03267a480d54c33a69ca1d7a4ae5
GIT binary patch
literal 8086
